<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Krabi Guide: 13 places – limestone cliffs, kayak, Muay Thai, cave, hot springs &amp; islands – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/krabi/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>2. Railay Beach</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Busy by day; come early or late. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/krabi/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>98.83653,8.01141,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Muay Thai at Ao Nang stadium</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Decide beforehand whether you are comfortable with the children’s fights. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/krabi/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>98.81331,8.04616,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Phra Nang Beach &amp; cave</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come early in the morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/krabi/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>98.83766,8.00594,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Ao Nang &amp; night market</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the evening to the night market. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/krabi/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>98.81204,8.04303,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Hot springs in the forest</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/krabi/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>99.